{"title":"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems\">2020 AMC 10B #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 12B Problems\">2020 AMC 12B #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Euclidean_Algorithm)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Euclidean Algorithm)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_PROBLEM_SOLVE!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY PROBLEM SOLVE!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The acute angles of a right triangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed029035047cb2533cbe0cafde67b2d4c6d1b022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\circ}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35098f620afd0d4f7dd6bcee2c8f743556cd518.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{\\circ}$\" width=\"14\" height=\"13\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/2/082852571ecc48ed136ba13dcffa8f6e40064bbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> and both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are prime numbers. What is the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b267da6156f3651912ba37dc13affab6778ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\  5 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the three angles of a triangle add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" /> and one of the angles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> because it's a right triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/a/0ca2a00fecab06c6f7c3f0c09d772ef5b3046e7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\circ} + b^{\\circ} = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The greatest prime number less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e609f93104b193a2355181ca62ff083ea9fd3821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$89$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/8/3086bb8e1b6d1f58366ab0e0cfa782de7f0254fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=89^{\\circ}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/86290e8097e111116145cdf4bdaa9c83db2acff5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=90^{\\circ}-89^{\\circ}=1^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"145\" height=\"13\" />, which is not prime.\n</p><p>The next greatest prime number less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1ad4a48099624f3bbfc16590f9be2d29351d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a11ca42d3d227474e5ddb9b218794167863df35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=83^{\\circ}$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3eb56956bcc53f1c44341cfcc3d0db580b15b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=7^{\\circ}$\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />, which IS prime, so we have our answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6cecfe394f16d2d6d7bc6844d2d845b2a014f077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> ~quacker88\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the answer choices, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are coprime to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the smaller angle, makes the other angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1ad4a48099624f3bbfc16590f9be2d29351d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$83$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> which is prime, therefore our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6cecfe394f16d2d6d7bc6844d2d845b2a014f077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Euclidean_Algorithm.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Euclidean_Algorithm)\">Solution 3 (Euclidean Algorithm)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Euclidean Algorithm)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561927316db89dcf4c2f7a4f2428c2e9d440b3d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b)=1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" /> By the Euclidean Algorithm, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ecd80a8a70cb0f3bc800f0ddc3d93571157b77a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\gcd(a,b)=\\gcd(a+b,b)=\\gcd(90,b)=1,\\]\" width=\"324\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are relatively prime.\n</p><p>The least such prime number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/43420adcd0fce9dce3978d53b97a8e0262b58da4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/9/9794b53cd08603be47400010261caa367eaf80a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=90-b=83$\" width=\"124\" height=\"12\" /> is also a prime number. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/c/aec44f81900a792533fd0f0d30699bb86bc6d449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"62\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_PROBLEM_SOLVE.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_PROBLEM_SOLVE!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY PROBLEM SOLVE!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY PROBLEM SOLVE!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/hE2fEOfviDw\">https://youtu.be/hE2fEOfviDw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Gkm5rU5MlOU\">https://youtu.be/Gkm5rU5MlOU</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/y_nsQ7pO63c\">https://youtu.be/y_nsQ7pO63c</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wH7xhYxwaFc\">https://youtu.be/wH7xhYxwaFc</a>\n</p><p>~AlexExplains\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B\">2020 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"20